--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Sound effects
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Every sound effect is synthesised at runtime (PlayTone in RushhouseUnityGame.cs)
from plain sine tones. No sample libraries are used and nothing above applies to
them. If the music files are absent the game still runs — SetMusic treats a
missing clip as silence rather than an error.

