--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Advertising SDK
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Assets/GoogleMobileAds/** and Assets/ExternalDependencyManager/** are the Google
Mobile Ads Unity plugin (v11.3.0), redistributed under the Android Software
Development Kit License Agreement / Apache License 2.0 as applicable:

  https://developers.google.com/admob/terms
  https://github.com/googleads/googleads-mobile-unity

Rushhouse uses REWARDED ads only -- the player opts in to each one in exchange
for a stated reward. There are no banners and no interstitials.

The App ID and ad unit ids currently compiled in are GOOGLE'S OFFICIAL TEST IDS
(ca-app-pub-3940256099942544/...). They always fill and never earn. Before any
public release, register the app in AdMob and swap them:

  Unity -batchmode -quit -projectPath . -executeMethod RushhouseAdMobSetup.Apply     -adMobAndroidAppId ca-app-pub-XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX~YYYYYYYYYY

and set RushhouseAds.LiveRewardedAndroid / LiveRewardediOS to the rewarded unit
ids. Shipping live ids while testing, or tapping your own live ads, is the usual
way an AdMob account gets suspended.

